Rationale (short)

  The extension bundles a WASM build (media/player/zmusic.wasm) that
  statically links run68, a 68000 emulator licensed under GPL v2.  The
  combined VSIX is therefore a derivative work of run68 and must be
  distributed under GPL v2 (or a later version) as a whole.

  Individual source files authored for this extension (everything under
  src/, media/player/*.{html,css,js}, syntaxes/, scripts/, test/) are
  original works by TAGAYA Ryo.  They are contributed under GPL-2.0-or
  -later so the combined distribution's license is unambiguous.

  Third-party components (abcjs, iconv-lite, z-music.js, X68Sound,
  run68/run68as) each retain their own upstream licenses.  See
  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the full breakdown.
